io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/8657816/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/8657816/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年学校でクラス替えあったら\n自己紹介決めてるの？\nやっぱり今度は\n「二年から来ました、\n伊藤万理華です。」？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/8657816/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないない笑\n二回も失敗したら笑えない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/8657816/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐはっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/8657816/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華はお化け屋敷とか大丈夫？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/8657816/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だめだめーだめx(\nでも...慣れたら大丈夫かなぁ？\nまぁ一緒に入ったら私\nキーキーうるさいだろう笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「わき腹いたいよ」"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/8657816/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うそ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤いスカートがかわいいのよ\nカラフルがすきなーのよ\nうねりぼさぼさ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...自分髪なげぃな!!‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日楽しみまりっっっっっか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}